    {
      "name": "Introduction",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 76,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 130,
          "text": "Alder was a small electronics workshop in the Lower Levels that built audio amplifier tubes entirely by hand. It lost its tooling after a third and last production run, and no one on the Station can make a tube like these today.\n\nThis guide will provide everything you need to know to appraise the value of any Alder vacuum tube.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "アルダーは、下層世界にあった小さな電子部品の工房で、音響用の増幅管をすべて手作業で組み立てていました。第3生産ロットを最後に設備を失い、今のステーションには、同じ真空管を作れる者はいません。\n\n本ガイドでは、あらゆるアルダー真空管の価格を判断するために必要な情報を掲載いたします。",
            "zh": "奥尔德是下层区一家小型电子元件工坊，所有音频放大电子管都由手工组装。它在第三批也是最后一批生产后失去了设备，如今空间站里没人能造出同样的电子管。\n\n本指南将提供鉴定任何奥尔德电子管价值所需的全部信息。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 212,
          "w": 150,
          "h": 56,
          "text": "Regardless of condition, an Alder tube has a base value of 250 Credits, and a minimum value of 70 Credits.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "状態に関わらず、アルダー真空管の基本価格は250クレジットで、最低価格は70クレジットです。",
            "zh": "无论品相如何，奥尔德电子管的基础价值均为250信用点，且最低价值为70信用点。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 206,
          "y": 208,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 160,
          "sprite": "tg_full",
          "fit": "stretch"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Alder Vacuum Tube Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Run",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "1. Production Run",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "1. 生産ロット",
            "zh": "1. 生产批次"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "The color of the bakelite base tells which production run a tube came from. The older the run, the better it was built.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ベースの色で、どの生産ロットの真空管かが分かります。古いロットほど、作りがよいです。",
            "zh": "底座胶木的颜色表明这支管出自哪一批生产。批次越早，做工越好。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "tg_lot_brown",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Brown Base: 1st Production Run (Years 372-381)\n(+300 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "茶色のベース：第1生産ロット（372〜381年）\n（+300クレジット）",
            "zh": "棕色底座：第1批生产（372-381年）\n（+300信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "tg_lot_black",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Black Base: 2nd Production Run (Years 382-395)\n(+80 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "黒いベース：第2生産ロット（382〜395年）\n（+80クレジット）",
            "zh": "黑色底座：第2批生产（382-395年）\n（+80信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "tg_lot_green",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Green Base: 3rd Production Run (Years 396-409)\n(No Change)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "緑のベース：第3生産ロット（396〜409年）\n（変化なし）",
            "zh": "绿色底座：第3批生产（396-409年）\n（价格不变）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Alder Vacuum Tube Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
