    {
      "name": "Glass",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "3. Glass",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "3. ガラス",
            "zh": "3. 玻璃"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "Haze builds up where the glass has been handled and heated. A crack lets the air in, and a cracked tube is dead.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ガラスは、手で扱われ、熱を受けた所から曇っていきます。ひびは空気を入れてしまい、ひびの入った真空管は動きません。",
            "zh": "玻璃在经手和受热的地方会逐渐发雾。裂纹会让空气进去，有裂纹的电子管已经失效。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
