    {
      "name": "Pins",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "4. Pins",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "4. ピン",
            "zh": "4. 管脚"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "A tube needs all seven pins to sit in its socket. A bent pin can still work; a pin broken off short cannot.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "真空管は、7本のピンがそろってソケットに収まります。曲がったピンでも動きますが、短く折れたピンは動きません。",
            "zh": "电子管需要七根管脚齐全才能插进管座。弯曲的管脚还能用，折断的管脚就不行了。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "tg_pins_ok",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Seven Straight Pins\n(No Change)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "7本そろったピン\n（変化なし）",
            "zh": "七根管脚完好\n（价格不变）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
