    {
      "name": "Emblem",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "5. Emblem",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "5. 印",
            "zh": "5. 标记"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 92,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 40,
          "text": "Every genuine Alder tube has this emblem printed on its glass, below the electrodes: a ring around a single lightning bolt.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "アルダー真空管のガラスには、電極の下に必ずこの印が印刷されています。輪に囲まれた、1本の稲妻です。",
            "zh": "每支正品奥尔德电子管的玻璃上，电极下方都印有这个标记：圆环围着一道闪电。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 140,
          "w": 96,
          "h": 72,
          "sprite": "tg_emb_genuine",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 132,
          "y": 140,
          "w": 158,
          "h": 72,
          "text": "Genuine Emblem",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "正規の印",
            "zh": "正品标记"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 226,
          "w": 96,
          "h": 72,
          "sprite": "tg_emb_fake",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 132,
          "y": 226,
          "w": 158,
          "h": 20,
          "text": "Counterfeit Example",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "偽物の例",
            "zh": "赝品示例"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 132,
          "y": 248,
          "w": 158,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "If any part of the emblem is different, the tube is counterfeit. A counterfeit never earns the Production Run or Original Condition bonus, and is worth -80 Credits.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "印のどこかが違う場合、その真空管は偽物です。偽物には、生産ロットとオリジナルの状態のボーナスが付かず、-80クレジットです。",
            "zh": "标记只要有任何一处不同，这支电子管就是赝品。赝品无法获得生产批次和原装品相的加成，价值为-80信用点。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Alder Vacuum Tube Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Set Bonus",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "Set Bonus",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "セットボーナス",
            "zh": "套装加成"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 96,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 240,
          "text": "<b>Original Condition</b>\nIf ALL conditions match:\n- Genuine emblem\n- Silver getter\n- Clean glass\n- Seven straight pins\n\nThe bonus depends on the Production Run:\n- Brown: +420 Credits\n- Black: +180 Credits\n- Green: +100 Credits",
          "translations": {
